cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "NFL Combine 40-Yard Dash Movement Time Series (2026)"
abstract: >-
  Per-frame multivariate time series of 276 forty-yard dashes from the 2026 NFL
  Scouting Combine broadcasts (164 athletes), labelled SKILL, STRONG or LINEMAN.
  Each run gives position along the lane, velocity, acceleration and pose channels
  (trunk lean, hip height, joint angles, stride) at 29.97 Hz between the start and
  stop of the on-screen clock, plus the unofficial 40-yard time. Distances are
  measured against the lane's dash marks and calibrated on the field's painted yard
  lines.
